Package: IVEA
Type: Package
Title: Integrative variational Bayesian inference of regulatory element activity
    for predicting enhancer–gene regulatory interactions
Version: 1.2.0
Author: Yasumasa Kimura
Maintainer: Yasumasa Kimura <yasumasa.kimura@daiichisankyo.com>
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    data.table,
    Matrix,
    invgamma,
    methods,
    utils
Description: IVEA is designed to use cell type-specific transcriptome data and 
    functional genomics data of chromatin accessibility and chromatin contact to
    estimate promoter and enhancer activities and calculate enhancer-gene 
    regulatory interaction scores.
URL: https://github.com/yasumasak/ivea
BugReports: https://github.com/yasumasak/ivea/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    ggplot2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
